{
 "family": "repositories",
 "note": "Leg 6-stores. A5: hosted, proxy and group of maven2, npm, docker and raw; the segment maven names maven2, and maven2 is no segment, as the save and the read take maven only; any other format or type is refused with 501 and the area repositories. ST8: a proxy needs proxy.remoteUrl, http or https with a host and no user part, else 400 at proxy.remoteUrl; another type needs none. For a subject without nexus:* (ruling ST11, which replaces the 403 of ST8) a remote whose host is an address of a closed network (the vectors of closed.json), a name with any such address, or a name that does not resolve, is refused with 400 at proxy.remoteUrl; with nexus:* every host passes. ST2: a hosted or proxy repository names the store local-write in storage.blobStoreName, a group a store that exists; a value the stored record holds is never refused (R6). ST13: the server owned attributes write_store, max_body_bytes, free_space_floor_bytes and remote_public_only are set on the host; a body value other than the stored one, or on a create other than the default (local-write, 10737418240, 2147483648, absent), is 400 not-offered at the key; null and an absent key are no value. ST7: a non null docker.httpPort or docker.httpsPort is 400 at that field unless the stored record holds it. ST9: no httpClient.authentication object keeps the stored secret; type none, empty or null removes it; type username with a password, or bearerToken with a token, writes it; an empty secret keeps the stored one; a secret with a control character, a username type without a username and an unknown type are 400. ST5: a repository a group names is not deleted, 409 with the groups sorted. ST10 with ST12: a create needs nexus:* or every permission its generated privileges grant: the administration and the view privileges of the repository by name, and with newFormat, the first repository of its format, the view privileges of every repository of the format. ST12: a group needs the view read permission of every member it adds.",
